328	    /**
329	     * Finds the id of an existing owner that {@code owner} soft-matches (a possible duplicate): one
330	     * that shares its lastName (case-insensitive) and postcode while carrying a <i>different</i>
331	     * telephone. This is a weaker match than the hard-duplicate identity key, so it is only meaningful
332	     * for an owner that is not itself a hard duplicate. When several owners match, the one with the
333	     * lowest id is returned; {@code null} is returned when there is no match (or lastName/postcode is
334	     * absent), meaning the owner is not a possible duplicate.
335	     */
336	    @Override
337	    @Transactional(readOnly = true)
